      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "When was the last time you wrote code just for fun? No deadlines, no tradeoffs…and no linters. Just good old-fashioned fun?",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "At November's meetup, we'll split off into pairs and work through different coding exercises. This is a beginner friendly event—there'll be plenty of experienced Rubyists to guide you.",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Please bring a computer, ideally with Ruby installed (",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "text": "installation guide",
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "link",
                "attrs": {
                  "href": "https://www.ruby-lang.org/en/documentation/installation/"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "). And try to have some fun! 🤠",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
